Title: La Bondad de Dios
Artist: Ben Fielding, Brian Johnson, Ed Cash, Jason Ingram, Jenn Johnson (Goodness of God)
Key: [Ab]
Original Key: Ab
Tempo: 63
CCLI: 7117726
Notes: Spanish version of Goodness of God. Lyrics: Essential Worship ft. Blanca, https://www.musica.com/letras.asp?letra=2579359

Intro:
[Ab]   [Db]

Verse 1:
Te amo [Ab5]Dios, tu a[Dbsus2]mor nunca me [Ab/C]falla
[Eb/G]Mi exis[Fm7]tir, en tus [Db]manos es[Ebsus4]tá [Eb]
Desde el momento que des[Fm9]pierto [Dbsus2]
Hasta el ano[Ab]che[Eb/G]cer  [Fm7]
